Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么想法呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许 印度的万圣节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Halloween is celebrated earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比美国来得要早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in India than in the U.S. maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗? 我真的不明白美国人的幽默{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I simply don't understand American humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我并不是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apologies. I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心 我懂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩也在等人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you two waiting for someone as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看是疯人院把病人全给放出来了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. I think the asylum let the patients out for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面的世界真疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit crazy outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说的还算轻的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,戴维斯参议员给哈瓦德维尔带来的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air dome research facility isn't the only thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:46.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并不只是空气室研究项目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}senator Davis brought to Harvardville.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它更像是发了疯的马戏团来到了城里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the wacko circus hit town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能再等了 我去拦的士了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm weary of waiting. I'm going to grab a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祝你们愉快 女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是哪个王八蛋泄露了我要来的消息?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell let it leak out that I was coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在这些该死的煽动者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now those damned agitators
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在外面搞了那么多麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are out there stirring up trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可不想这样 让他们滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need this. get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这他们是什么玩意儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What tar pit did this crap ooze out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我给您换一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'll get you another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.85,0:06:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不管怎么做 把他们赶掉就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what it takes, just get rid of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有必要 就逮捕他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest them if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 先生 我们没有理由逮捕他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But. Sir, we don't have any grounds for arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们没做犯法的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They haven't done anything illegal yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参议员 我可以提个建议吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator, may I make a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以从大门偷偷的溜出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could slip out through the regular entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没人会料到的 所以他们也不会注意我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one would expect that, so the crowd won't notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 见鬼 我才不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可是被推选的行政官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an elected official.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不会像丧家之犬一样偷偷的溜出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not skulk out of here like some whipped dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你让那群暴乱份子滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now. I won't budge from this spot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不然我就不走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until you get that swarm of vermin out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那个坏蛋 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bad guy. Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他 是我们在电视上看到的那个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him. the bad guy we saw on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,戴维斯参议员 能问您一句吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Davis. can I have another word?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不行  - 请说两句 参议员 说两句吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You cannot.  - Please, senator. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就问一个问题 您为什么...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one more question. why would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么鬼东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼 在这儿等我 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani, wait here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是别人让你扮成这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did someone put you up to this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是你自己天才的想法?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is this stupid costume your brilliant idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 天才 你有话要说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, genius, you got something to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他从我面前滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get it off your chest and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闹够了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夫人 您有参与吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, are you involved in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从某种意义上说 有间接参与吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indirectly, in a manner of speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 从某种意义上说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, in a manner of speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您也得和我走一趟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're coming with me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不行 请等一会儿  - 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, wait just a minute.  - Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh  my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走 走 走 快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move. out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,离他远一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away from him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太迟了 他已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late. he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们快点离开这鬼地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away. hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你要去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait. where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从哈瓦德维尔机场为您发来的现场报道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reporting live from Harvardville Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一名威尔制药公司的反对者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A protestor demonstrating against Wilpharma corporation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,袭击了一名警员 据称该警员已殉职{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}attacked and supposedly killed a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但现在 那名警员又以类似的方式...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, that same officer has just attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,袭击了东·戴维斯参议员的保镖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}senator Ron Davis' bodyguard in a similar manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱迪 你为什么停下来了? 怎么...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eddie, why did you stop rolling? wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,柯蒂斯·米勒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curtis Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有在候机厅的人请注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all persons inside the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,立即疏散 离开大厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate the building immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重复一次 立即疏散 离开大厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, evacuate the terminal immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是演习 所有的出口已开通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a drill. use all exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人立即疏散 离开大厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone evacuate the terminal building immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一切都不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当地警方将整个机场封锁为一级防范区域...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Local police have secured the entire airport in a lockdown...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有入口区域被封锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and access into the area is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,官方并未公开详细情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorities are not releasing details
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have very little information.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们所得到的信息非常有限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 据未确实的报道称...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, according to unsubstantiated reports...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在机场的某候机厅内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bioterror event has occurred
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生了生化恐怖袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in one of the airport terminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,东·戴维斯参议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Ron Davis is among those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也被滞留在了机场内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are confined within the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 他的情况...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At present, his condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不懂你们为什么不让我离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand why you won't let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么我们不能进行营救?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we stage rescue operations?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求您了 警长 跟您的上司谈一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Chief. you've gotta talk to your higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您也听见911的呼叫了 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the 911 call, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托了 求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 又给傻逼警长打电话了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Chief jackass again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在什么情况?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the status of the site?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,整个机场都被封锁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the entire airport is completely blockaded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们被2个人袭击了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were attacked by two people
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们应该是刚被感染的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I believe were recently infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们抓住了他们 把他们锁在了特遣部队的车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We caught them and locked them up in a task-force vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽管如此 把被感染的人关起来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even so, becoming infected by being bitten...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像是恐怖电影里的情节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like something out of a horror movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些人从坟墓里慢慢爬出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those creatures rising up out of their graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 开个玩笑嘛 不过说真的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I'm just kidding. But seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得是威尔制药公司的药物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you think this Wilpharma drug
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,致使他们这样的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has something to do with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然这之间有联系 就无法制止...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if there is a connection, that shouldn't kick off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个令人毛骨悚然的瘟疫悄无声息的爆发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a spontaneous outbreak of some creepy-ass plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很明显是那恶心的恐怖主义所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It definitely reeks of terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这也可以解释为什么国家卫生局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That explains why the State Board of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么快就送个傻逼到这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Health hauled ass to get here so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你觉得政府想极力掩盖这件事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think the suits are trying to cover up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我知道了 我会受不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I knew that. I'd have a hell of a lot more clout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白宫派了个特工来接手这个烂摊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White House sent a special agent to handle this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他应该快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ought to be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以问问他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽管问 但是说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask all you like, but honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个问题没什么好说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to discuss on that subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里昂·S·肯尼迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon.S.Kennedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是那个家伙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you're the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是拨打911的电话之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one of the 911 calls that was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 还有多少幸存者  - 算上我总共4个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many are alive?  - Four  including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参议员受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One's wounded. the senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以告诉我你的位置吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you give me your location?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在VIP休息厅 抵达厅的最西侧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the VIP lounge, west end of the arrivals lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 我不知道我们还能撑多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. I don't know how long we can hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乘那些东西发现我们之前立即支援 请快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send help now before those things get at us. please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是从这里打出的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most likely  that call came from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们就在大气航空公司的VIP休息厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe they're in the VIP lounge for atmos airlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前 机场警察和国家卫生局的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, the airport police and State Board of Health...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是第一急救者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the first responders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们彻底关闭了在里面的主要入口...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've completely shut down the main entrance here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和两边的入口 这里和这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the two side entrances here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有其他的路通往候机厅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no other routes into the terminal building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好的办法是用直升机...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe our best bet is to fly in by helicopter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,飞到屋顶 从那里进入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and enter through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个小队应该由...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the team should be comprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩跟我走 其他人就不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the two of you. no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:16:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可不想冒增加感染人数的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't care to risk increasing the number of infectees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也不想被迫向你的朋友开枪 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to be forced to shoot your friends, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等会儿 你不是说真的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. hey. Hold on a second. You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他以为他是谁啊? 长的都不像军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who does this guy think he is? He doesn't look military.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是来处理这场灾难的特工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the special agent assigned to this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们拭目以待吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just see what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感染病毒者会攻击别人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those infected with this virus will attack other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何人 无一例外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anyone, without exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被咬的人受到感染 再去攻击别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people that are bitten become infected and go on to attack others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有摧毁感染者脑部 才能阻止病毒传染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to stop the infection is to destroy the infectees' brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,摧毁他们的脑部?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy their brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射击他们的头部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot them in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僵尸们的丧歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The song of the infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放松点儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救援马上就到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这是干吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不许动 不然我开枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop or I'll shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这怎么可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angela.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们喜欢吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 想尝点枪子? 别管我  - 够了 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want some of this? get off.  - Stop, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on. yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快停下 够了  - 别管我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's enough. Stop.  - Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.93,0:20:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事 伙计?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我打到她了 没理由啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shot her point blank. there's no way I could've missed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉过你 只有射击头部才可以毙命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you. the only way to stop them is to shoot them in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是他们唯一的软肋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their only vulnerable spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,切记 否则就是浪费时间和子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget it, otherwise you'll waste time and ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么做 带来的就是死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that can prove to be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.37,0:21:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有枪声  - 他们派救援过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those were gunshots.  - They sent help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们能离开这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们真该谢谢我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不是知道我在这儿 他们才不会管你们死活呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you hadn't told them I was here, they would've ignored your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想想你的秘书把你丢在这里送死...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to stick your ego up your ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还能自我感觉良好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}considering your own secretary left you here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么声音?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人没受到感染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who isn't infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太迟了 我们帮不上什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 如果你要去 那我跟着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. I mean if you, then I leave too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 克莱尔 别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Claire, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸走时也是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my father left  he said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.47,0:22:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说要去帮妈妈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he was going to go help my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果他们俩都没有回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he didn't come back  and neither did she.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你走了 你也不会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you leave, you won't come back either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我保证  - 真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I promise.  - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,顺便问一下 我们这儿有什么东西可以当武器吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, do we have anything here that can be used as a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真没想到这也能派上用场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never saw this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.66,0:23:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没回答 可不是好兆头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No answer. Never a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里昂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你怎么在这儿?  - 我还想问你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here?  - I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.77,0:24:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是那个秘书?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么点儿人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没错  - 增援呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yup.  - Reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.31,0:24:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有 我们靠自己出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. We're getting out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,指望你有个什么计划是不是太奢望了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it too much to hope you at least have some sort of a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们从大厅直接穿出去  - 你有病啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're gonna run across the lobby.  - Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大厅里爬满了怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lobby is crawling with those creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里最为开阔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's also the widest area.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绕远路太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too dangerous to take the long way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.33,0:24:31.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.13,0:24:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们行动迟缓 能冲过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They aren't fast. We can get by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么时候民间组织成员...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since when did the NGO member...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.84,0:24:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对这些东西也这么专业了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}become such an authority on the subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是浣熊市少有的幸存者之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's one of the rare survivors of Raccoon city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她比这里任何一个人对这噩梦般的遭遇...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has more experience with this kind of hellish nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.41,0:24:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更有发言权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than anyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,浣熊市不就是那个...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, raccoon city, isn't that where the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.65,0:24:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.38,0:25:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟上我 瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep up with me. Rani.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.48,0:25:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 走  - 多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.09,0:25:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.71,0:25:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.06,0:26:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他被咬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的 他被咬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He damn well got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.63,0:26:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.37,0:26:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 格雷格 等等  - 格雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Greg. Wait.  - Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来搞定?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.27,0:26:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.87,0:26:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格雷格 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格雷格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greg!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.09,0:26:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看起来能好到哪里去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like I'm okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.77,0:26:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要从这里出去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we going to make it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.64,0:26:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们仔细分析过 这里直通出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a clear view and a straight path to the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.58,0:27:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽可能的都出去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take out as many as we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.52,0:27:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拼命的跑出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and run like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪拉 掩护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angela, back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能再快点干掉他们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you get rid of them any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们开始向这里集聚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're starting to gather over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们跑不出去了 是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna make it out, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.15,0:27:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,越来越难了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们马上出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.55,0:28:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够悬的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.66,0:29:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 瑞尼 没事吗?  - 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rani, are you okay?  - Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.20,0:29:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参议员跑哪里去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the senator?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.87,0:29:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.34,0:29:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.92,0:29:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,光 朝着有光的地方跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The light. run towards the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.71,0:30:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把这里包围起来 行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that perimeter set up. move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别站着不动 行动起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stand there, man. set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快 快 开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move in, move in. open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.62,0:30:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把他们毙了 全都毙了  - 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Light them up, boys. light them up.  - Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rani.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿姨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.30,0:30:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 阿姨  - 我的天啊 你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aunt.  - Oh  my god. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.97,0:30:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吓死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿姨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.38,0:30:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿姨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到处都是怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我以为再也看不到你了  - 真受不了小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't think I would see you again.  - I can't stand kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.25,0:31:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,整天在那里唧唧歪歪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可怜的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh  my poor darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.93,0:31:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是因为你 那个小女孩的余生里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl will have nightmares...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.96,0:31:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都会有恶梦陪伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the rest of her life because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.30,0:31:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我 把她给我 求求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go. give her to me. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.93,0:31:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来吧 我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.07,0:31:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我了解 宝贝 但是她没事 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey. I know. But she's fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.88,0:31:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是需要点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.48,0:32:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最坏的情况下可以用这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can use that in the worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没打算让威尔制药...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no intention of letting Wilpharma...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.50,0:32:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像个英雄那样结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}end up looking like a savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.85,0:32:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(威尔制药)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.70,0:32:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈尼根 我来报告情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey  Hunnigan. I'm reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经听说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.23,0:32:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关键时刻海军抵达 挽救了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The marines landed in the nick of time and saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.03,0:32:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听到这消息 你不知道我有多欣慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how relieved I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能拿到授权真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm amazed and impressed you got authorization for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.91,0:33:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你肯定用了些私人关系  - 没错 我有些人脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must have pulled a few strings.  - Yes. well. I have my resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.41,0:33:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从陆军传染病医学研究所得到确认...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I received confirmation from usamriid...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次袭击的病毒的确是T病毒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} that the virus used in this attack was indeed the T-virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.48,0:33:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我向总统呈交了方案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I submitted a plan to the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,作为紧急法案发布实施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He pushed it through as a special emergency act.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.26,0:33:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个参加战斗的海军都注射疫苗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every marine involved in the assault was vaccinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.73,0:33:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 恐怖分子提了什么条件?  - 还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have the terrorists made demands?  - No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.96,0:33:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几分钟前联邦调查局在洛杉矶...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the FBI captured a member of general grande's army...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逮捕了一个葛兰多军队的军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Los Angeles just moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.13,0:33:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,审讯他的时候可能会得到些信息...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we interrogate him, he might give us some information...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.30,0:33:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,建立起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that'll establish a link...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.04,0:33:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这起恐怖袭击和印度那次的联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between this terrorist attack and the one in india.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.77,0:33:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许还能得到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll dig up a lead on the where abouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.08,0:33:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一些前保护伞公司职员的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of former umbrella corporation employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肯定是他们把病毒流到黑市上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've gotta be the ones peddling the virus on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.05,0:33:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.65,0:33:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,威尔制药公司的药怎么送到这里来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are Wilpharma drugs being brought here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.16,0:33:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你 你在这儿干吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.03,0:33:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是威尔制药的首席研究员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's Wilpharma's head researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.73,0:34:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来介绍下 这是弗雷德里克·道因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I introduce Frederic Downing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是他研发了针对病毒的疫苗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one who developed a vaccine for the virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是你特别熟悉的那种病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which you  in particular, are so familiar with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.98,0:34:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是指候机厅里的那些感染者?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the infection in the terminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.45,0:34:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得是威尔制药一手策划的 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought that was wilpharma-engineered, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.25,0:34:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可笑至极{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Utterly ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.76,0:34:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,预防接种疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An inoculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.43,0:34:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们研究的是这个 防止疫情蔓延的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they've been working on. A way to prevent further outbreaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.10,0:34:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 但是...  - 克莱尔 是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But...  - Claire, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.74,0:34:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你知道?  - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You knew?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是不知道使用许可审批会如此之快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think its use would be sanctioned this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就在印度进行人体试验...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the human testing that took place in India...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掌握了T病毒的恐怖分子发起的袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An attack by terrorists that somehow got hold of the T-virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,葛兰多支持的所有组织成员...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the members of the group supported by general grande...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.95,0:34:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都已被感染 我们无法得知内幕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were infected, so we don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美国政府得到印度专家的许可...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U.S. government obtained permission from Indian authorities...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,向邻近国家销售T病毒疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to administer the T-virus vaccine to the nearby communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.13,0:35:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,威尔制药秘密研制了疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vaccine secretly developed by Wilpharma.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且非常成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.33,0:35:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感染率下降到了最低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The infection rate was kept as minimal as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.47,0:35:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们为什么为了疫苗发起这场袭击?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell didn't you break out the vaccine for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.87,0:35:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果在进入前接种疫苗 格雷格就不会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we'd been inoculated before we entered the terminal. Greg would...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.17,0:35:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接种疫苗会让袭击救援人员...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inoculation would have been entirely possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没法帮我们做广告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had terra-save not backed us into an adversarial corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.55,0:35:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能不能通过正常手续...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had we been able to follow proper procedure...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.99,0:35:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根据原始计划 疫苗作为国家医药资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as outlined in the original schedule, the government medical stockpile.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.79,0:35:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,12小时内美国随处可以买到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have been shipped anywhere in the U.S. within 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天啊 那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god. then...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这都是我们的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.63,0:35:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那里我可不会跟你吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't argue with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.81,0:35:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们最后把事情搞得更糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just ended up making things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.98,0:35:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些混帐才用的上那些疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The villains here are the ones who used the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.95,0:36:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比他们更坏的是那些研发疫苗的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But worse than them are the ones who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.02,0:36:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,7年前我们的命运被保护伞公司的病毒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven years ago  our lives were changed forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,永远改写了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the virus from umbrella corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.74,0:36:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保护伞公司倒闭了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella collapsed...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他们的病毒在继续传播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but their viral legacy continues to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要把这些病毒从地球上灭绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna scrub this virus from the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.39,0:36:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你选择的救赎者角色 比我的抗争者要好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chose the role of rescuer rather than fighter, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你选择了一条你哥哥和我 都无法追随的道路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chose a path that your brother and I couldn't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.30,0:36:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没有错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.00,0:36:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里昂 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.58,0:37:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找些灭火器来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find some extinguishers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.29,0:37:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在气罐爆炸前清空这块地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear the area before the gas tanks blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他人在哪儿? 快点跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the rest of the team? come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.29,0:37:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这玩意儿怎么用  - 救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do I use this thing?  - Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁来帮帮我 我被卡住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help. I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来了 我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, i'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.13,0:37:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点 跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.58,0:37:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 发生什么事了?  - 装疫苗的卡车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened?  - The trucks carrying the vaccine...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.48,0:37:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还剩下多少疫苗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much vaccine is left?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.72,0:37:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天带到这儿的疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything we brought today
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.00,0:37:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经是我们从公司的疫苗库里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was all we were able to scrape together
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.12,0:37:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能找到的所有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from vaccine samples inside the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.62,0:37:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而绝大多数都在刚才的爆炸中丢失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And most of that has just been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.06,0:37:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那研发数据呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the manufacturing data?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.69,0:37:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 难道你认为他们也在找数据吗  - 有可能吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think they're after the data too?  - Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.06,0:37:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你不告诉我们 他们的要求是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell us what their demands are already?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.83,0:37:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你不愿意说 我可以直接去问总统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't wanna talk I'll just go directly to the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.27,0:38:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真相?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.74,0:38:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们要事实的真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They demand the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.38,0:38:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由保护伞公司研制的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The viral weapon from which umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.95,0:38:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒已经变异了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}corporation's T-virus was derived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们想还每一个被美国政府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanna reveal everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.08,0:38:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,牵涉进来的人以清白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the U.S. government who was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.19,0:38:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府究竟做过些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was the government really involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,证据已经同浣熊市一起灰飞烟灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The proof went up in smoke with Raccoon city.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 真相并没消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. the truth didn't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.33,0:38:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 根本就没有什么证据  - 那你就去向恐怖分子们解释吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There never was any.  - Convince the terrorists of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.09,0:38:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果他们得不到想要的东西 会发生什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they don't get that information, what will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们会在全美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll disperse the T-virus
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.95,0:38:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的居民区散播T病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in every populated area in the u.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.43,0:38:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后期限是午夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deadline is midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.84,0:38:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只剩下4个小时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's only four hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.64,0:38:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且现在也没有疫苗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's no vaccine left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道我们就不能找出那些恐怖分子是些什么人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we find out who the terrorists are?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.78,0:38:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我找到他们其中一人的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a clue as to the identity of one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在首批被感染者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right after the first infected victims
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.00,0:38:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出现在机场候机厅的时候...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appeared in the airport terminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.88,0:38:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我注意到一个在大厅的男人 他的名字叫柯蒂斯·米勒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed a man in the lobby. His name is Curtis Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.79,0:38:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道他 他是那些反对建造{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know him. He's one of those bleeding hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.32,0:38:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的研究设备的顽固分子之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}protesting the construction of the new research facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.26,0:38:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果恐怖分子的要求仅仅是公开那些...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the terrorists' demands are the release of information...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生在浣熊市的真相...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on what really happened in raccoon city...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.63,0:39:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- ...那他可能...  - 不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...Then he might...  - It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.50,0:39:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,柯蒂斯·米勒是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curtis Miller is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.84,0:39:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.55,0:39:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我哥哥是不会做这种事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother wouldn't do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.19,0:40:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他曾因威胁威尔制药被捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was arrested for threatening Wilpharma.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.43,0:40:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他仅仅是要求真相被公之于众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just demanded information be made public.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.66,0:40:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不幸的是 其他人并不这样看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, the rest of the world doesn't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.87,0:40:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果象你所说的 他不是恐怖分子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you claim he's not a terrorist
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.50,0:40:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你不把他带到这儿 让他自己说? 现在就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you bring him here to explain himself? Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.44,0:40:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得带这么多家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sure packing a lot of hardware
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去见你哥哥合适吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to go see your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.48,0:40:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.38,0:41:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去办公室看看疫苗的研发数据还在不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to the office and check on the development data.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.22,0:41:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能帮上什么忙吗? 别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you with something? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.12,0:41:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我并不是想潜入你们公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not scheming to infiltrate your organization
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.50,0:41:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去干什么不法的勾当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my own devious purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.06,0:41:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恐怕只有一件事你能做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid there's only one thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.00,0:41:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同我一道喝下午茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join me for a late afternoon tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.27,0:41:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 感觉舒服吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are. Comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.27,0:41:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人作伴真是件不错的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be nice to have some company.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.38,0:42:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是到柯蒂斯家去的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the road to Curtis' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.34,0:43:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,3年了 我没有听到过哥哥的任何消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't heard a word from Curtis in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.85,0:43:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在浣熊市事件中他失去了自己的妻儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lost his wife and child in the Raccoon city tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.22,0:43:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真奇怪 居然不认我的卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's odd. It won't accept my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.59,0:43:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 以前发生过这种事吗?  - 没有 这还是第一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has that happened before?  - No. This is the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.43,0:43:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(错误)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.73,0:43:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来得用主控密码才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to use the master code.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.64,0:44:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(解锁)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们正在进入一个空气室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're entering an air dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,屋顶是由内部和外部的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The roof is supported by creating a difference
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,气压差支撑起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the exterior and interior air pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,系统的危险程度由每个部门中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The danger levels in this facility are assigned
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.07,0:45:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所植入的微生物来衡定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}according to the microbes that are handled in each section.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.20,0:45:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从右边开始 危险程度从1上升到4{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the right, the levels ascend from 1 to 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.01,0:45:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,数字越大 危险程度越高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The higher the number, the higher the danger level.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.27,0:45:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过请放心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest assured, however, that there are
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.03,0:45:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这儿有严格的安全措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stringent safety measures in place
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.25,0:45:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,预防突如其来的安全事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the unlikely event a problem occurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.02,0:46:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果在浣熊市的废墟上有任何动静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything positive rose from the ashes of Raccoon city
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.39,0:46:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它的保安及防御系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that security and safeguard
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.90,0:46:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将会自动提升等级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}standards have been elevated
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.89,0:46:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来防止灾难发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to avert any future calamities.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.59,0:46:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个0指的是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about this zero area?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.16,0:46:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那代表研究员的办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That contains researchers' offices
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.06,0:46:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及会议室等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meeting rooms and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.17,0:46:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是我们待会儿要去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where we're headed next.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这儿可不是天堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.23,0:47:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我需要你帮我做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you came to assist me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.90,0:47:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.71,0:47:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闻起来不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.95,0:47:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你在做什么?  - 检查研发数据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing?  - Checking on the development data.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.70,0:47:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(东·戴维斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.69,0:47:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你好 参议员先生  - 我猜你现在一定在那儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, senator.  - I figured you must be there by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.33,0:47:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.63,0:47:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么把那个女人带过去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you bring that woman there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该不会是下不了手吧 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not feeling sorry for her, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.10,0:47:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这可不象你的作风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.71,0:48:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你不明白吗? 这是我们的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you understand? This is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.05,0:48:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.22,0:48:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.42,0:48:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.99,0:48:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说什么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.46,0:48:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么事 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing of any consequence. I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说了些什么 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said something to you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.33,0:48:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他警告我不要给你看任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He warned me not to let you see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.57,0:48:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我看见什么不该看的 会有什么后果吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it cause trouble if I saw something in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.61,0:48:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.65,0:48:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我刚入警队的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I started out as a rookie cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.48,0:48:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奉命去营救一个被困在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I responded to a call about a small child
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.95,0:48:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洪水之中的小沙丘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was stranded on a sandbank
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.00,0:48:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面的小男孩儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of a flooding river.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.46,0:48:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我激动的跳入水中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I impulsively jumped into the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.70,0:48:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但接下来我知道的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next thing I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.93,0:48:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是我躺在医院的床上 意识模糊不清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was waking up in a hospital bed  bleary and disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.87,0:49:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来他们告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They informed me afterward
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.24,0:49:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我救下了那个小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I had saved the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.58,0:49:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但3个SRT的警官却{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But three S.R.T. members were injured
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.48,0:49:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为弥补我捅下的篓子而受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while fishing my sorry butt out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.06,0:49:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说到沮丧 当时的我简直万念俱灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about depressed. I felt lower than dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.89,0:49:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,脑海中总是在想 我怎能让他人来承担自己犯下的过错?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was I thinking, putting others in harm's way like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.87,0:49:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更别提我也差点送命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention that I could've been killed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.27,0:49:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但柯蒂斯对我说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then Curtis said something
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.81,0:49:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我停止了为自己愚蠢行为的哭泣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That made me stop beating myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.29,0:49:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"如果你不试着去拯救每一个生命"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you don't try to save one life
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.56,0:49:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"那你就拯救不了任何人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never save any."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.10,0:50:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但最后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the end
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他却在自己的信念中迷失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His own words came back to haunt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.22,0:50:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我过去 让我过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me through. Let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一些东西 但戴维斯不想让人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something, but Davis wants it to remain hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.95,0:50:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是G病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the G-virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.24,0:51:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们这儿有这东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.17,0:51:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是最高机密 连公司里的人也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It remains a secret even within the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.34,0:51:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至政府机构也不知道它的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government affiliates don't know about it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.94,0:51:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是通过特殊手段得来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was obtained through special means.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.85,0:51:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们和参议员也不过是为了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A group with which neither we nor someone
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.48,0:51:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,共同的利益才联合起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the senator's position can be associated.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.68,0:51:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是从黑市上得到这东西的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.45,0:51:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打算拿G病毒做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you plan on doing with the G-virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.42,0:51:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,制造疫苗 但就算是参议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Create a vaccine. But even the senator
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.60,0:51:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也难以向政府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't adequately express
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.19,0:51:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陈述此项目的潜在威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The threat posed to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.20,0:51:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个从初始就被定义为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plans were shelved
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.00,0:51:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,级别4的项目就这样被搁置了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it remains in level 4 ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.70,0:51:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参议员是决定炸毁浣熊市的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The senator is a member of the committee
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.87,0:51:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,策划者之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That decided to bomb Raccoon city.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.81,0:51:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得把这个告诉里昂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta tell Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.77,0:51:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 不 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, no. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.74,0:51:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你这么做了 那我该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do that, what's going to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.98,0:51:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你告诉我这些的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't seem worried about that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.00,0:51:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没看到你脸上有什么担心的表情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you were telling me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.32,0:52:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像... 好像...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like... looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.40,0:52:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,服务器出了点问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something wrong with the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.09,0:52:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得去阻止柯蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to stop Curtis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.21,0:53:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克莱尔 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.61,0:53:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里昂 现在马上到威尔制药来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon, get over here to Wilpharma right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.48,0:53:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们有G病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got the G-virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.92,0:53:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们本打算想制疫苗 就像T病毒那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were gonna make a vaccine like for the T-virus
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.69,0:53:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但戴维斯刚才打电话给弗雷德里克叫他毁掉证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Davis just called Frederic and told him to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.86,0:53:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 弗雷德里克在那儿吗?  - 他刚出去修服务器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is Frederic there?  - He just went to go fix the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.03,0:53:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或者是去释放病毒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or he may have gone to dump the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.03,0:53:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不可能  - 克莱尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Couldn't be.  - Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.90,0:53:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,屋子里有电话打进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a call coming from inside the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.57,0:53:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 克莱尔?  - 弗雷德里克? 你在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Claire?  - Frederic? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.87,0:53:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 在4区  - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In level 4.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.74,0:53:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说去检查服务器的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were going to the server room.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.44,0:53:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在路上看到可疑的人 于是就跟着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw someone suspicious on my way and followed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.15,0:53:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你必须马上出来 这儿有一个定时炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get out. There's a time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.38,0:53:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就要爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.02,0:53:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们将会经历另一场浩劫 如果...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have another biohazard if this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.69,0:53:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克莱尔? 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire? Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.53,0:53:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 该死的  - 发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn it.  - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.93,0:53:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道 电话断线了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. We got cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.73,0:54:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人注意 系统发生错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all personnel. a system error has occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.07,0:54:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请停止一切活动 迅速撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminate all activities immediately and evacuate the dome
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.88,0:54:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到安全措施重新恢复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until safe conditions are re-established and verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.85,0:54:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人注意 系统发生错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all personnel. a system error has occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.18,0:54:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请停止一切活动 迅速撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminate all activities immediately and evacuate the dome
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.89,0:54:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到安全措施重新恢复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until safe conditions are re-established and verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.87,0:55:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人注意 系统发生错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all personnel. a system error has occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.08,0:55:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请停止一切活动 迅速撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminate all activities immediately and evacuate the dome
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.88,0:55:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到安全措施重新恢复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until safe conditions are re-established and verified.
