Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.61,1:23:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我绝不借恐怖主义之手完成这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no way in hell I would support terrorism to ensure that.
