Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.44,1:24:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 遵循你的吩咐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, per your request.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.72,1:24:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,葛兰多将军 现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of now. General Grande...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.79,1:24:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有您才拥有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only you will be in possession...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.65,1:24:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒及其疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a set of the T-virus and the T-vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.29,1:24:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,基于国家想把病毒的事保密...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing would offer greater advantage when negotiating...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.63,1:25:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用这个去跟他们谈判 最好不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a country that wants to keep the existence of this virus a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.01,1:25:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不必担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.18,1:25:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一步我都有周详的计划...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've anticipated everything down to the last detail...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.94,1:25:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至连如何逃生我也计算好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including my own escape arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.92,1:25:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别忘了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.48,1:25:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,G病毒的数据 可是要另外加钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you owe me extra money for the data on the G-virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.39,1:25:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后 作为朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one last thing, As a friend...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.13,1:25:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我的劝告 别管G病毒的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heed my advice and forget about G.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.86,1:25:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这玩意儿容易突变 很难掌控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stuff is wickedly volatile, and it can't be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.91,1:25:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时间正好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.79,1:26:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你答应只身前来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to come alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.86,1:26:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只想再看看你的这张脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to see your face one more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.53,1:26:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.50,1:26:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仅存的疫苗和繁殖数据在我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the last of the vaccine, and the development data.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.33,1:26:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是世上仅存的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all that remains in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其余都销毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.11,1:26:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.71,1:26:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩比任何人都更能明白情况...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two can appreciate the situation better than anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.91,1:26:31.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们还和受感染的人碰过头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after your up-close-and-personal experiences with virus victims.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.65,1:26:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类需要这疫苗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mankind will need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.80,1:26:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,慢着 求求你别杀我 我们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. please. don't shoot me. let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.14,1:26:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是个聪明女人 聪明的女人都喜欢钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a smart woman, and smart women like money.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.94,1:26:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能给你钱 我们五五分帐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make you rich. we'll split everything 50-50.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.64,1:26:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,七三分好了 有三成我就满足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant 70-30. I'm happy with 30.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.05,1:27:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你 全给你好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. please, take it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.35,1:27:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别... 别杀我 我求求你们 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't... don't kill me. I'm begging you. please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.42,1:27:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可怜虫不值得我杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too pathetic to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.64,1:27:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 所有小队 行动  - 是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All units, move in.  - Yes  sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.60,1:27:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,疑犯已被制服 接受监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect has been apprehended and is in custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,弗雷德里克全招了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frederic confessed everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.29,1:28:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他还给印度恐怖分子提供病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was also the one that provided the t-virus to the terrorists in India.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.69,1:28:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还装成黑市卖家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He even acted as the black-market broker.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.77,1:28:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在浣熊城的生化危机爆发前夕...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole the T- and G-viruses...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.74,1:28:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他盗走了T病毒和G病毒 逃离城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then escaped right before the Raccoon city disaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.87,1:28:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他知道病毒要和疫苗配套出售才有市场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Frederic decided he could only sell them as a set with a vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.44,1:28:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他消去以前的记录...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he erased his past...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.71,1:28:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混进威尔制药公司...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found employment at Wilpharma...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.61,1:28:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并得到研究设备的任意使用权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gained unrestricted access to their research facilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.25,1:28:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在制造疫苗的时候...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had the luxury of searching for potential customers...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.22,1:28:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他就开始寻觅潜在的客户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while manufacturing the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.42,1:28:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是为什么他联系上葛兰多将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how he stumbled upon General Grande.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.33,1:28:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有恐怖袭击事件...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The terrorist incidents were demonstrations...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.63,1:28:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是为了在将军面前展示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}staged for general grande's benefit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.13,1:28:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,类似于...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.50,1:29:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变相的商品宣传{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}twisted sales pitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.11,1:29:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的哥哥只是他们的一只棋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my brother was just a tool to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.91,1:29:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为人所用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was used.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.71,1:29:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不能免除柯蒂斯的罪过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't absolve Curtis of what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.48,1:29:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但至少 我们和他也有相同之处...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we share something in common with him...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.22,1:29:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是热切希望...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's his passionate desire...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.19,1:29:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,浣熊市的悲剧不再重演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prevent any further tragedies like Raccoon city.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.35,1:29:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.96,1:29:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.96,1:29:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚点联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.87,1:30:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里昂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时间的话 我们再一起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go diving together again...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.31,1:30:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跳水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometime.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.55,1:30:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,荣幸之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love to.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.93,1:30:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩啥时候去跳水了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you two go diving?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.00,1:30:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别打听了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.40,1:30:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更重要的是 你以后有何打算?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More importantly, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.37,1:30:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,需要载你一程吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.00,1:30:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有轿车载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a limousine waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.97,1:30:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.28,1:30:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下次再会的时候...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time we bump into each other...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.65,1:30:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望能在一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's hope it's some place...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.65,1:30:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正常点的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little more normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.25,1:31:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.22,1:31:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下次见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.03,1:31:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,东·戴维斯参议院宣布辞职消息...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Ron Davis announced his resignation...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.23,1:31:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他被指以大股东身份...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after being accused of insider trading with Wilpharma stock...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.80,1:31:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幕后操纵威尔制药的股价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a company of which he is a major stockholder.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.84,1:31:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下面是国际消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next in international news
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.65,1:31:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米格·葛兰多将军突然决定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Miguel Grande has suddenly decided to participate...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.85,1:32:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,参加中亚裁军计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a central asian disarmament conference.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.18,1:32:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但当中因由 无从得知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the real motivation behind his participation is not yet known.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.39,1:32:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,此举获得政府的支持...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Government sources seem to be optimistic about the turnaround...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.26,1:32:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,声称这可以减缓经济衰退...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and say that it is to alleviate economic blockades...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.49,1:32:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但有谣传...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while rumors state that it is because...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.63,1:32:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他被削去研究生物武器的权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his ability to produce biological weapons has been removed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.36,1:32:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(机密档案删除中)
